The yoga tail sharing!

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:45.950
Got you, finally.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:02:59.130
taken away.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:08.680
in tatters but Coco will never find happiness again you see I created a

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:13.620
separate personality by implanting a strong darkness within Coco's heart this

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:18.560
evil Coco will disappear if my spell book burns and she will return to the

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:23.030
Coco you know at the one with a gentle heart but I've left a little going

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:27.680
away present for Coco for all the things she's done for me for the rest of her

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.980
life inside that pretty little head of coke.

