00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:46.520
Ordinarily, human beings partnered with other ancient Momodo lose their memory after their spell books have been burned.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:54.320
However, Coco is special. As my partner, she was receiving a special sort of mind control.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.970
She'll have her free will, and her memory will remain. Coco will return...

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:05.170
But she will remember the countless crimes she committed alongside me.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.620
She will suffer from that guilt for the rest of her life.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.460
All the people she's wounded,

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:14.680
not to mention the terrible things she said to her very best friend, Sherry.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.860
Every time she remembers them,

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.200
she'll feel a pain worse than anything else she's ever felt.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.550
She'll lose the will to go on.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.970
Opus, erase Coco's memory everything from the time she met you until...

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:34.170
Oh, I know you have the power to do it because you've done it for the others

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.480
I'm way ahead of you Zophus. I knew you'd pull something like this if you lost

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.740
That's why I told the other Momodo not to lay their hands on you

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:50.400
That's why your book hasn't been burned immediately now erase Coco's memory or you're the one who will suffer

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:55.660
True that I can erase her memory

