WON'T!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.940
Why should I do you any favors? This is my final revenge over you! Give it up!

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:07.970
Brace it! You have to!

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:15.740
Forget it! Now hurry up and burn that spellbook! I'll be on my way back to the Momodo world!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.850
