00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:24.170
Oh, that's right, you can't! I'm the only one that can erase Coco's memory!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.070
Zophis! Zophis!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:34.960
Just a little further.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:40.950
Just a little further and I can take Coco out of the tunnel and into the light.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.410
Even in the end, Zophus' evil will still influence her.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.360
Please, I want to save Coco.

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.870
Coco who has worked so hard.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.880
Gentle Coco I knew growing up.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.980
How can I force Zophus to erase her memory?

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.640
What's the matter, Sherry?

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.430
