00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.480
ZOO FIIIIIIIIIIIIII-

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:23.020
Zophus. You ran away from me, didn't you?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.390
Wha...what are you talking about?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.960
I'm talking about that time, the time-

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:41.480
It was the time when I discovered Sherry and laced her ardome towards Sherry, and I stepped in front to protect her.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.380
So, what about it?

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:50.920
The issue is what happened after that. You seemingly left the scene without noticing me.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:57.650
But there's no way for a Momodo with as sharpened intuition as you not to have noticed me from that close a distance.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.260
So you ran away.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.800
Because you were really afraid of me.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.700
Huh? Huh?

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:09.730
When we arrived at the ruin, we were interrupted several times by ancient Momodo, who were nothing more than weaklings.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:14.260
Thanks to that, it took us an excessively long time to get here.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:14.720
Huh?

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.990
Sophus, you've been afraid of me since day one.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:24.080
What are you trying to say, Brago?

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:29.960
Spend a lifetime in fear!

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:34.250
Running away from me even after returning to the Momodo world?

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:48.410
You will do anything you do want!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.410
Promise, Coco will be returned to the way she was before!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:05.140
UGHUHUHUHUH Official

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.360
Is it really all-

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.240
Yes, Satch.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.800
