00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.860
But I will burn it for sure.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.840
That's one thing you can count on.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:29.970
I under-

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.190
I always knew you could do it from the very beginning.

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.930
Boy of the Red Book, you've become strong.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:38.950
Really? You think so?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.770
Yes, Zatch, I know so. But next time.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:44.740
Next time?

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.430
Hurry, Miss Sherry. I'm concerned about your leg. The hospital's waiting.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:59.920
All right, I'm coming. Thank you all. I am grateful to each and every one of you.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.080
Have a safe journey home.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:04.140
Goodbye.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:26.340
Done.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.520
Yes, you've all performed magnificently.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.920
Sadly, we had friends that returned to the Momodo world.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:35.230
It's important not to forget them.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.160
Your victory is their victory.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.560
The future of the Momodo world has been protected from the hands of evil.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:44.980
I believe that a difficult ordeal awaits us in the next battle.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:50.250
However, I hope you all aim toward becoming a good king with the same spirit as you have now.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.990
And I will help you.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.550
