this during that time you saved me from the evil one you've always saved me every time i got in

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:42.900
trouble you've been there for me even when i ran out of money and i thought about not going to

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:48.020
college you were there to cheer me up and talk sense even though you had your own problems to

